      "writtenOn": "2025-07-09T22:25:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I am a bit hesitant about this change as I suspect it may break native Dawn users since most people are just passing the default `InstanceDescriptor`. I\u0027m wondering if it would be possible to keep it default enabled for native, maybe with a warning for now to give some time for users to migrate?",
