      "message": "At the moment Chromium has multiple instances, see https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:gpu/command_buffer/service/dawn_instance.cc;l\u003d1;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1?q\u003ddawn_instance.cc and callers.\n\nThis approach seems fine as well though.",
